  measure
  sack
  basket
  load
ind.mkt.trend
  steady
  dearer
  cheaper than anyone remembers
  not to be had
  plentiful
  up by a little
ind.mkt.trend2
  much as last week
  scarce since the rains
  sold out by noon
  cheap enough to be suspicious
  dear, and the sellers unashamed
ind.mkt.verb
  held its price, to the surprise of the dealers
  fell by a fifth on news of a good year
  rose again, and the bakers say they will follow it
  sold slowly, the buyers waiting for the new harvest
  was all sold before the bell
ind.mkt.other
  the {herd} sold well, the best of them to buyers from {city2}
  {fish} were cheap, the boats having had a good week
  {crop2} was dear and poorly sorted
  the {vessel} from the {craft} shops found few buyers
  the carts sold {drink} by the cup, against the bylaw
  a fine {beast>.b} was sold for {n} {coin}, which is too much for a {.b}
ind.mkt.crop2
  at {n} {smallcoin}, much as before
  scarce, and the millers holding back
  plenty, if you know whom to ask
  dearer by a {smallcoin} the measure

# ---- the council ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ind.council
  {ind.cn.who} {ind.cn.verb} {ind.cn.what}.
  {ind.cn.who} {ind.cn.verb} {ind.cn.what}, {ind.cn.tail}.
ind.cn.who
  The council of {$home}
  The town fathers
  The board of works
  The aldermen of {$home}
  The water board
  The council, sitting late,
  (gov=monarchy) The king's officers at {$home}
ind.cn.verb
  have voted to
  have decided, after three sittings, to
  will consider whether to
  have refused again to
  have been asked by many ratepayers to
  have promised, not for the first time, to
ind.cn.what
  pave the road to the burying ground
  light {streets.of} until the last bell
  build a public bath at {town.open}
  close the {craft} works by the river after complaints of the smell
  buy a new pump for the fire company
  move the {herd} market out of the town
  plant {tree} along the new avenue
  mend the roof of the school, which has leaked since the founding
  number the houses of {$home}
  forbid the keeping of {herd} within the walls
  charge {n} {smallcoin} a stall at the {festival} fair
  clean the {watersrc.n}
ind.cn.tail
