  and to report by {season.next}
  which the ratepayers have heard before
  if the money can be found
  over the objections of the members for the old town

# ---- the courts -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ind.court
  {ind.ct.lead} {ind.ct.who} was fined {n} {coin} for {ind.ct.offence}.
  {ind.ct.lead} {ind.ct.who} was sent to prison for {n} days for {ind.ct.offence}, and said {ind.ct.said}.
  {ind.ct.lead} the charge against {ind.ct.who} of {ind.ct.offence} was dismissed, the witness having {ind.ct.witness}.
ind.ct.lead
  At the {$home} court yesterday,
  In the magistrates' court,
  Before the bench this week,
  At the sessions,
ind.ct.who
  a carter of {$home}
  a {ind.ct.trade} from the lower town
  a young man from the hills
  a woman who keeps a stall at {town.open}
  the landlord of an inn by the market
  a youth who would not give a trade
