  letting {herd} into the burying ground
  being drunk on {drink} in {town.open}
  singing after the last bell
  keeping a {beast} without a licence
  fighting at the {festival} fair
  fishing above the weir without leave
  watering {drink}
  stealing {vessel} from the market yard
  throwing stones at the lamps
  driving too fast through {streets.of}
